以下是一个简单的 Java 类，它实现了一个整数的栈数据结构：

```java
public class IntStack {
    private int[] stack;
    private int top;

    public IntStack(int size) {
        stack = new int[size];
        top = -1;
    }

    public void push(int data) {
        if (top == stack.length - 1) {
            System.out.println("Stack overflow!");
        } else {
            stack[++top] = data;
        }
    }

    public int pop() {
        if (top == -1) {
            System.out.println("Stack underflow!");
            return -1;
        } else {
            return stack[top--];
        }
    }

    public int peek() {
        if (top == -1) {
            System.out.println("Stack is empty!");
            return -1;
        } else {
            return stack[top];
        }
    }

    public boolean isEmpty() {
        return (top == -1);
    }
}
```

